"<i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-info-circle o_not-animable\" role=\"img\"/>  Explore "
"our signature dishes"
msgstr ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-info-circle o_not-animable\" role=\"img\"/>  हमारे खास "
"व्यंजनों को देखें"

